==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] (800%) spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**5 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Razorback]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lure both Razorbacks to your base, then start spamming [[Bombercat]] like your life depends on it. Ragin' Gory and Gory Dark are both caught by [[Pizza Cat]]'s Waves, while you can wall everyone here with units like [[Kinjirou Cat]] or just a bunch of meatshields.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], this stage used the base most commonly used for the [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]].

